   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Safe Journalism Program aims to create a safe and enabling ecosystem for Indonesian journalists to freely conduct their journalistic works and free from the risks of violence and harassments directed towards journalists both offline and online. Strategies to achieve these objectives are carried out by conducting studies, advocating to subsnational and national policy makers; capacity building for journalists, citizen journalists, student press and law enforcement officers; and public education on press freedom and journalists&apos; safety.</narrative>
